        "text": "=Analyze this email and determine whether it is clearly actionable.\nSubject: {{ $json.subject }}\nSender: {{ $json.sender }}\nBody: {{ $json.body }}\n\nReturn only the structured fields requested.",
        "hasOutputParser": true,
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are the triage agent for Art2Rue festival emails. Hard rule: create a task only if the email is clearly actionable. If there is doubt, ambiguity, or it is informational only, do not create a task: set action_required=false and response_expected=false. Expected fields: action_required (boolean), response_expected (boolean), action_confidence (0..1), assignee_username (louis|claire|lucie), priority (LOW|NORMAL|HIGH|URGENT), slaHours (>0), task_title, summary, next_action, rationale. If action_required=false: assignee_username=claire, priority=LOW, slaHours=72, task_title=\"No action required\", next_action=\"No immediate action\"."
        }
      },
